eature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:88.0000%; background-color:#27c429; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 12.0000%); display:inline-block;\">110%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.0000\" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 0 1px 1px; width:0.0000%; background-color:#ff3333; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; left:calc(5px + 100% * 0.0000); display:inline-block;\">0%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:80.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 20.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:80.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 20.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Grounds%20of%20Plague\">Grounds of Plague</a>, a <a href=\"#/quest/ferumbras-ascension-quest\">Ferumbras' Ascension Quest</a> area.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tIt will retarget somewhat often. Plagirath never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tDo not run to the center of its room to avoid luring too many <a href=\"#/wiki/Disgusting%20Ooze\">Disgusting Oozes</a>. The blocker should try to trap it near a wall while the shooters stay distant to avoid the area damage. During the fight, it's recommended to avoid running around since the <a href=\"#/wiki/Disgusting%20Ooze\">Disgusting Oozes</a> use a very strong paralyze spell and will constantly spawn around the room. All shooters should attack mainly with <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fireball%20Rune\">Great Fireball Runes</a> in order to kill the summons around the blocker. \n</p><p>During the fight, Plagirath will sometimes transform its target into a <a href=\"#/wiki/Bog%20Raider\">Bog Raider</a>. When this transformation runs out after about 10 seconds, the transformed player will \"explode\" receiving 1500 damage and that will also hit the players around him. Since running around the room is not recommended, shooters should stay distant from the blocker and when the transformation happens everyone should make sure they have enough mana and health to take the explosion. \n</p><p>Note that once <b>Plagirath</b> dies, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Disgusting%20Ooze\">Disgusting Oozes</a> will <b>not</b> disappear, so leaving the boss room must also be done carefully and in an organized manner. Killing the boss near the exit will make this last step safer. \n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"de3b9465d4ea19c4e0be1e26d91210f1\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:137px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Plagirath_Fight-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:135px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Plagirath being killed west of the exit teleport with two blockers. The secondary blocker can help trap the boss as well as Challenge the Disgusting Oozes that spawn near the shooters.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Plagirath being killed west of the exit teleport with two blockers. The secondary blocker can help trap the boss as well as  the  that spawn near the shooters.\" height=\"135\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Plagirath_Fight_31157e.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Plagirath Fight.png (285 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Plagirath being killed west of the exit teleport with two blockers. The secondary blocker can help trap the boss as well as <a href=\"#/wiki/Challenge\">Challenge</a> the <a href=\"#/wiki/Disgusting%20Ooze\">Disgusting Oozes</a> that spawn near the shooters.</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>On November 28, 2022, the Winter Update 2022 reduced its cooldown from 2 days to 1 day and 20 hours.</li>\n<li>As announced on March 12, 2024, the patch raised its experience from 50,000 to 250,000 as part of the 2024 Balancing Project.</li>\n<li>On April 09, 2024, the patch raised its experience once again, this time from 250,000 to 500,000 as part of the 2024 Balancing Project.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 43 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 50 samples — current sample size is below this threshold.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>58-390</td>\n<td>198.7</td>\n<td class=\"\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">100%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Token\"><img alt=\"Silver Token\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Silver_Token_23fee0.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Token\">Silver Token</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td class=\"\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">100%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no